    "note": "Baked in-engine by TreeRigBaker from docs/art/rigs/treeIsoRig.js — REGENERATE rather than hand-edit (Hidden Harbours > Art > Bake Acadian Trees). pivotX/pivotY are the TRUNK FOOT in cell px from the top-left; nearFlarePad rows of near-root flare sit BELOW it, which is why a tree does not pivot bottom-centre. unityPivot is the same point normalised bottom-origin, and trunkAnchor is that height as a fraction of the cell — the wind shader's _TrunkAnchor for this species.",
    "rig": "docs/art/rigs/treeIsoRig2.js",
    "global": "TreeRig2",
    "ppu": 32,
